@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@jwtToken = reemplazar-con-jwt
@cronToken = reemplazar-con-cron-job-token
@jobId = 1
@orderId = 1

### Listar jobs de eventos de pago
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cron-job/payment-event-jobs?status=pending&page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Ver job por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cron-job/payment-event-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear job manual para una orden APROBADA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cron-job/payment-event-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "order_id": {{orderId}}
}

### Resetear job
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cron-job/payment-event-jobs/{{jobId}}/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Procesar jobs pendientes (endpoint consumido por crontab)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cron-job/payment-event-jobs/process?limit=50
X-Cron-Job-Token: {{cronToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Eliminar job
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cron-job/payment-event-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json
